WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:07.215
Mr. Yaba, what's the matter?

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:08.717
Are you all right?

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.393
Oh, you're here too, Michiru?

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:21.104
Have you gotten used to this town?

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.148
Yes. Kind of.

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:25.233
My, you seem unsure.

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:28.403
Chief Inspector, Yaba is escaping!

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:39.748
That's Yaba?
He's totally different than before!

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:40.790
He sure is.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.669
You have permission to fire! Fire!

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.597
Damn! How did he become so brutal?

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.348
I'll stop him!

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.310
-What's that?
-There's a fire!

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:04.064
Yes, it's taken effect, just as expected.

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.608
We can't let him do any more damage!

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.651
He must be stopped!

00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:14.491
He's smashed through the fence!
He'll get into the city!

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:23.374
What?

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.047
Shirou!

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.508
I'm good. I can handle this.

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:33.301
But your arm!

00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:39.557
It's all better?

00:01:44.896 --> 00:01:47.315
How can it resist even Ogami?

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:51.111
If that thing gets into the city,
there will be big trouble!

00:01:56.241 --> 00:01:58.535
-What are you doing?
-I'll take care of it!

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:03.998
I'll carry him
to where there aren't any people!

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:06.668
-Don't be stupid! Get away!
-No!

00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:09.504
Quit thinking you can do everything alone!

00:02:09.838 --> 00:02:14.008
When the chips are down,
I can do what needs to be done!

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:24.686
Then show me what you can do!

00:02:29.524 --> 00:02:31.067
Flap your wings harder!

00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:33.945
Harder!

00:02:34.028 --> 00:02:37.198
Give me even larger wings!

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:42.370
She's lifting that?

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:44.747
Quit struggling!

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:46.040
You bastard!

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:50.378
-The pier! There's nobody out there!
-Got it!

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:58.052
-He's struggling again!
-Drop him!

00:02:58.136 --> 00:03:00.930
-From this high up?
-I don't care! Just do it!

00:03:01.055 --> 00:03:02.724
-I'll be fine!
-Okay!

